  {
    "episode_id": 82998,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/2/82998.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 27,
    "turn_text": "Both. I'll say I'm very hopeful. A lot of times on the outside, you might look in and say, there's only a small group of good people and everyone else does a corporate hack and they don't care about anyone. But having conversations with my colleagues, I've been so surprised by so many people who I get in the conversation with them and I find out what they're about and their values and I'm like, okay. You're actually a lot more progressive and forward thinking that other folks might think, and I think the problems people have smaller goals because they understand the landscape and the battlefield that we have in Congress right now. And I think when we show those politicians and everyone that good policy equals good politics, then I think people will get the courage that they need to stand up for what we need in this country.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_02",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
    "explicit_propositions": [
      {
        "text": "I am very hopeful.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Good policy leads to good politics.",
        "confidence": 0.94
      },
      {
        "text": "Many people outside perceive others as doing corporate hacks and not caring about others.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "Demonstrating that good policy equals good politics can inspire people to act courageously.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Conversations with colleagues have revealed surprising levels of progressiveness and forward-thinking values.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Some individuals have values that align more closely with progressive ideals than commonly assumed.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "There is a small group of good people inside organizations.",
        "confidence": 0.87
